title: "STRIDE: Systematic Trend & Risk-Integrated Daily Execution"
abstract: >-
  A systematic trend-following trading system with volatility-based risk
  management, Kelly-capped leverage and a kill switch, built as a 12-month
  live experiment and an open technical portfolio project.
